{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Astronook is a relaxing astronomy game where you inherit your late grandpa\u2019s study. Take up stargazing, astrophotography and discover cosmic wonders; all with a warm beverage at hand. Your study may be small, but through your telescope, a whole new cosmos is now within reach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503880/extras/GIF_01.gif?t=1745675621\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore space at your own pace from the comfort of your snug new study room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2728 Map out <strong>magical constellations</strong> in star-mapping puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcf8 Use your star chart to find and <strong>photograph a variety of charming planets</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2604\ufe0f Keep tabs on the latest cosmic news - who knows what <strong>celestial wonders</strong> you'll find?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcd2 Print your photos and fill up your <strong>stargazer\u2019s scrapbook</strong> with all your discoveries</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503880/extras/GIF_03.gif?t=1745675621\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3503880?t=1745675621","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503880/7690bfdf2e59a3a345910b4e9524ea5a74ea388f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745675621","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503880/bb07b2aca25aa57e92dfb1ea1854effdcc8cc83c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745675621","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503880/bb07b2aca25aa57e92dfb1ea1854effdcc8cc83c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745675621","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"descripti